{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the <strong>first 15-20 minutes\u00a0</strong>of the full game, you'll uncover what happened just a few hours before you made the decision to head to your vacation home.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The introduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive\u00a0mechanic</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The following features are <strong>NOT included</strong> in the demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Episode 2:\u00a0</strong>Terrors to Unveil - Day Off Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the second episode of the series Terrors to Unveil. You decide to spend your day off at your countryside house, unaware of what awaits you upon arrival. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features Demo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric environment and photo-realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive\u00a0mechanic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687550?t=1747816811","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687550?t=1747816811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687550/c65a815b31f5b9b4c9ba8f2b84954be91d7b0e38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747816811","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687550/c65a815b31f5b9b4c9ba8f2b84954be91d7b0e38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747816811","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thi